  "gaps": [
    "Student's chosen concentration is not known; the 15-semester-hour concentration block is recorded as one requirement. Course lists per concentration: Addiction Treatment Facility Management (PSYC324, HRMT411, MGMT312, BUSN310, MKTG301); Correctional Healthcare Facility Management (CMRJ316, PSYC324, CMRJ303, BUSN310, CMRJ308); Emergency Management (EDMG220, EDMG230, EDMG420, PBHE413, PBHE426); Leadership (HRMT411, ITMG421, MGMT312, MGMT313, MGMT314); Mental Healthcare Facility Management (PSYC324, PSYC221, CHFD230, HRMT411, MGMT312), each course 3 semester hours.",
    "Capture does not state any residency (institutional credit) requirement or transfer credit limits, so no requirement is marked institutionalOnly.",
    "HCAD498 footnote states: Prerequisite: Senior Standing and completion of all major courses prior to enrollment; must be taken as the last course before graduation. Capture does not state whether it must be completed at the school.",
    "Individual credit values for courses within general education selection lists are not printed; only block totals are given.",
    "Footnote 1: all literature courses require ENGL101 or ENGL110; minimum grade requirements and GPA requirements are not stated in the capture."
